---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Products" description="Shree Om Sai Packaging product range: Corrugated steel cable drums, process drums, and M.S tie rods for industrial dispatch." canonical="https://www.sospackaging.com/products">

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="relative w-full h-[55vh] min-h-[350px] flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-primary">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-cover bg-center" style="background-image: url('/images/products-hero.webp');"></div>
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-neutral-dark/80 to-primary/80"></div>
    <div class="relative z-10 text-center px-4 md:px-8 max-w-[1280px] mx-auto">
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-extrabold text-white mb-6 drop-shadow-lg">Products</h1>
      <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-surface-gray max-w-2xl mx-auto drop-shadow-md leading-relaxed">
        Heavy-duty steel packaging solutions engineered for the cable industry
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Product Details -->
  <section class="py-24 px-4 md:px-8 max-w-[1280px] mx-auto bg-surface-container-lowest">
    <div class="space-y-24">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
        <div class="bg-surface-container-low rounded-xl h-72 flex items-center justify-center shadow-sm border border-border-gray overflow-hidden relative">
          <img src="/images/actual/Steel_cableDrum.webp" alt="Corrugated Steel Cable Drum" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover" />
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/50 to-transparent"></div>
          <span class="relative z-10 text-white font-bold text-2xl text-center drop-shadow-lg">CORRUGATED STEEL<br/>CABLE DRUMS</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-primary mb-6">Corrugated Steel Cable Drums</h2>
          <p class="text-base text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Corrugated Steel Cable Drums are an alternate for wooden drums. They can be used more than one time! Also they have a recovery cost of at least 30% by scrapping them. They are eco friendly as they avoid using wood.
          </p>
          <p class="text-base text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed mb-6">
            These drums have replaced the traditional wooden drums in the wire and cable industry. They are definitely more solid and durable compared to wooden reels. The life of corrugated steel drums is longer and thus the expense for the user is less compared to those users of wooden or plastic reels.
          </p>
          <a href="/contact?product=corrugated-steel-cable-drum" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-success-green text-white text-sm uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold px-6 py-3 rounded hover:bg-primary transition-all duration-200">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-lg">request_quote</span>
            Enquire Now
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
        <div class="order-2 lg:order-1">
          <p class="text-base text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Process drums are specialized heavy-duty steel containers designed for in-house cable twisting, sheathing, and extrusion lines. Built to withstand continuous industrial use, they are essential for manufacturing operations that require reliable material handling between process stages.
          </p>
          <p class="text-base text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Manufactured to exact customer specifications, our process drums integrate seamlessly into existing production lines. The galvanized framework provides enhanced stability and strength, ensuring both the cable and drum are properly maintained throughout the manufacturing process.
          </p>
          <a href="/contact?product=process-drum" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-success-green text-white text-sm uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold px-6 py-3 rounded hover:bg-primary transition-all duration-200">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-lg">request_quote</span>
            Enquire Now
          </a>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-surface-container-low rounded-xl h-72 flex items-center justify-center shadow-sm border border-border-gray order-1 lg:order-2 overflow-hidden relative">
          <img src="/images/product-process-drum.webp" alt="Process Drum" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover" />
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/50 to-transparent"></div>
          <span class="relative z-10 text-white font-bold text-2xl text-center drop-shadow-lg">PROCESS<br/>DRUMS</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
        <div class="bg-surface-container-low rounded-xl h-72 flex items-center justify-center shadow-sm border border-border-gray overflow-hidden relative">
          <img src="/images/actual/M.S_Tie_Rods.webp" alt="M.S Tie Rods" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover" />
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/50 to-transparent"></div>
          <span class="relative z-10 text-white font-bold text-2xl text-center drop-shadow-lg">M.S TIE<br/>RODS</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="text-base text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed mb-4">
            High-strength mild steel tie rods are critical components for drum assembly and structural bracing. They provide the necessary tension and reinforcement to keep steel cable drums intact during transport and handling.
          </p>
          <p class="text-base text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Available with galvanized finish for superior corrosion resistance and long service life, our M.S tie rods are engineered to meet the demanding requirements of the cable industry. They are designed for easy installation and reliable performance across all drum sizes.
          </p>
          <a href="/contact?product=ms-tie-rod" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-success-green text-white text-sm uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold px-6 py-3 rounded hover:bg-primary transition-all duration-200">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-lg">request_quote</span>
            Enquire Now
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
        <div class="order-2 lg:order-1">
          <p class="text-base text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Hybrid Drums are a combination of steel structure & PVC sheet. They are economical as compared to steel cable drums. They are also eco friendly as they also avoid using wood. Can be used for smaller size drums.
          </p>
          <p class="text-base text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Designed for cost-effective performance, our hybrid drums offer excellent impact resistance and dimensional stability across varied environmental conditions. They are an ideal choice for manufacturers seeking to optimize shipping costs while maintaining the reliability and protection that steel packaging is known for.
          </p>
          <a href="/contact?product=hybrid-drum" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-success-green text-white text-sm uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold px-6 py-3 rounded hover:bg-primary transition-all duration-200">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-lg">request_quote</span>
            Enquire Now
          </a>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-surface-container-low rounded-xl h-72 flex items-center justify-center shadow-sm border border-border-gray order-1 lg:order-2 overflow-hidden relative">
          <img src="/images/actual/hybrid_drum.webp" alt="Hybrid Drum" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover" />
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/50 to-transparent"></div>
          <span class="relative z-10 text-white font-bold text-2xl text-center drop-shadow-lg">HYBRID<br/>DRUMS</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
        <div class="bg-surface-container-low rounded-xl h-72 flex items-center justify-center shadow-sm border border-border-gray overflow-hidden relative">
          <img src="/images/actual/Export_Quality_drum.webp" alt="Export Drum" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover" />
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/50 to-transparent"></div>
          <span class="relative z-10 text-white font-bold text-2xl text-center drop-shadow-lg">EXPORT<br/>DRUMS</span>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-primary mb-6">Export Drums</h2>
          <p class="text-base text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed mb-4">
            All our drums are manufactured to international export standards, ensuring they meet the rigorous demands of global shipping, handling, and storage. From material selection to final finishing, every drum is built to withstand the harshest logistical conditions while maintaining product integrity.
          </p>
          <p class="text-base text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Our export-quality drums are designed for safe ocean freight and container loading, with low-weight construction that matches the cost efficiency of wooden drums while delivering superior durability and reusability.
          </p>
          <a href="/contact?product=export-drum" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-success-green text-white text-sm uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold px-6 py-3 rounded hover:bg-primary transition-all duration-200">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-lg">request_quote</span>
            Enquire Now
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
        <div class="order-2 lg:order-1">
          <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-primary mb-6">Refurbished Drums</h2>
          <p class="text-base text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Our refurbished steel cable drums offer a cost-effective alternative for manufacturers looking to reduce packaging expenses without compromising on quality. Each drum undergoes thorough inspection, cleaning, and reconditioning to restore its structural integrity and performance.
          </p>
          <p class="text-base text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed mb-6">
            By choosing refurbished drums, customers benefit from significant cost savings while supporting a circular economy. This sustainable approach extends the lifecycle of steel drums, reducing waste and raw material consumption.
          </p>
          <a href="/contact?product=refurbished-drum" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-success-green text-white text-sm uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold px-6 py-3 rounded hover:bg-primary transition-all duration-200">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-lg">request_quote</span>
            Enquire Now
          </a>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-surface-container-low rounded-xl h-72 flex items-center justify-center shadow-sm border border-border-gray order-1 lg:order-2 overflow-hidden relative">
          <img src="/images/actual/Drum.webp" alt="Refurbished Drum" class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover" />
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/50 to-transparent"></div>
          <span class="relative z-10 text-white font-bold text-2xl text-center drop-shadow-lg">REFURBISHED<br/>DRUMS</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Export Quality -->
  <section class="py-16 px-4 md:px-8 max-w-[1280px] mx-auto">
    <div class="bg-primary rounded-2xl p-10 md:p-12 text-white relative overflow-hidden shadow-lg border border-primary-container">
      <div class="absolute -right-20 -top-20 w-80 h-80 rounded-full bg-secondary opacity-20 blur-3xl"></div>
      <div class="absolute -left-20 -bottom-20 w-80 h-80 rounded-full bg-success-green opacity-10 blur-3xl"></div>
      <div class="relative z-10 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-10 items-center">
        <div>
          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded border border-white/20 text-white text-xs uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold mb-4">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm">flight</span>
            Export Quality
          </div>
          <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4">Export Quality Drums</h2>
          <p class="text-base text-on-primary/80 leading-relaxed">
            All our drums are manufactured to international export standards, ensuring they meet the rigorous demands of global shipping, handling, and storage. From material selection to final finishing, every drum is built to withstand the harshest logistical conditions while maintaining product integrity.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-3 sm:gap-4">
          <div class="bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-sm p-4 sm:p-5 rounded-lg border border-white/10 hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-white mb-3 text-3xl">verified</span>
            <div class="text-sm font-bold mb-1">ISO Certified</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-on-primary/70">TUV Rheinland approved quality management</div>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-sm p-4 sm:p-5 rounded-lg border border-white/10 hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors sm:mt-6">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-white mb-3 text-3xl">anchor</span>
            <div class="text-sm font-bold mb-1">Sea-Worthy</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-on-primary/70">Engineered for safe ocean freight and container loading</div>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-sm p-4 sm:p-5 rounded-lg border border-white/10 hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-white mb-3 text-3xl">weight</span>
            <div class="text-sm font-bold mb-1">Optimum Weight</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-on-primary/70">Low-weight design matching cost of wooden drums</div>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-sm p-4 sm:p-5 rounded-lg border border-white/10 hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors sm:mt-6">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-white mb-3 text-3xl">recycling</span>
            <div class="text-sm font-bold mb-1">Fully Recyclable</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-on-primary/70">100% steel — infinitely recyclable with zero waste</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>
